@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor 学生 as Student
actor 教师 as Teacher
actor 实验室管理员 as Admin
actor 统一身份认证系统 as AuthSystem

rectangle 预约业务子系统 {
  usecase "提交预约申请" as UC_Submit
  usecase "校验用户身份" as UC_Verify
  usecase "查询可预约时段" as UC_ViewSlots
  usecase "校验预约规则" as UC_Validate
  usecase "生成待审核申请" as UC_Generate
}

Student --> UC_Submit
Teacher --> UC_Submit
AuthSystem --> UC_Verify

UC_Submit ..> UC_Verify : <<include>>
UC_Submit ..> UC_ViewSlots : <<include>>
UC_Submit ..> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC_Submit ..> UC_Generate : <<include>>
UC_Generate --> Admin : 通知
@enduml
